/**
 * @defgroup MIDILAR_Protocol Protocol
 * @ingroup MIDILAR
 * @brief MIDI protocol primitives: channels, groups, masks and data values.
 *
 * - `Channel` and `Group` store the wire value `0-15`, built through
 *   `FromWire()` or `FromNumber()` (SPEC-MIDI-4).
 * - `ChannelMask` and `GroupMask` are sets of the sixteen addresses; Omni is
 *   `ChannelMask::All()` (SPEC-MIDI-5).
 * - `NoteNumber`, `ControllerNumber` and `ProgramNumber` are 7-bit values
 *   (SPEC-MIDI-6).
 * - `Velocity` (16-bit), `ControllerValue`, `PressureValue` and `PitchBend`
 *   (32-bit) keep MIDI 2.0 resolution with a MIDI 1.0 view, converted by
 *   `ScaleUp()` and `ScaleDown()` (SPEC-MIDI-3).
 */

/**
 * @namespace MIDILAR::Protocol
 * @ingroup MIDILAR_Protocol
 * @brief MIDI protocol primitives.
 */
